cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Decoupling analysis code for composite metabolic indices and biological aging"
abstract: >-
  R scripts implementing a three-stage decoupling framework (cross-sectional,
  longitudinal, Mendelian randomization) to separate algorithmic collinearity
  from biological association between composite metabolic indices and aging clocks.
